// Where the first line's text starts: left + first, and for a list item no earlier than the left indent and no earlier than the end of the label, so the label never overlaps the text.
// By hand: a bullet item at level 0 has left 3072 and hanging 1536, so the label is at 1536 and the text at 3072 as long as the label is narrower than 1536.
lp_xfirst(View v, int i) {
  int xl = lp_ind(v, i, (import word_p_left));
